                Notices                                                           ✕

                extension_failed · an extension failed to start or missed its
                deadline, so loading skipped it

                config_invalid · a configuration file is invalid: one extension key
                is set under both its full and short name

                stream_closed · this session's log can't be read past here; reopen
                the session to try again

                key_clash · Two actions share the key Ctrl+F: `search` and
                `search_results` act in a context they share, so both entries
                reverted to their defaults. Rebind one of them with /keys. An entry
                equal to the defaults counts as unset.

                Esc closes

